@IzTrade.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5032

### Register New User
POST {{IzTrade.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trader@iztrade.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Login User
POST {{IzTrade.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trader@iztrade.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Get User Wallet Balance
GET {{IzTrade.API_HostAddress}}/api/wallet/user/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Place Buy Order (Pending Check)
POST {{IzTrade.API_HostAddress}}/api/order/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
  "orderType": "BUY",
  "price": 50000.0,
  "quantity": 0.01
}

###

### Get Order Book Depth
GET {{IzTrade.API_HostAddress}}/api/order/orderbook/BTCUSDT
Accept: application/json

###

### Place Sell Order (Matching Engine Trigger)
POST {{IzTrade.API_HostAddress}}/api/order/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "symbol": "BTCUSDT",
  "orderType": "SELL",
  "price": 50000.0,
  "quantity": 0.01
}

###

### Get User Orders History
GET {{IzTrade.API_HostAddress}}/api/order/user/1
Accept: application/json